+### Local native Bridge routing
+
+| Variable | Default | Source File | Description |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `MITM_LOCAL_HOST` | `127.0.0.1` | `src/mitm/server.cjs` | Local OmniRoute ingress host used by the native Bridge. |
+| `MITM_TARGET_AGENT` | `claude-code` | `src/mitm/server.cjs` | Native client profile routed through the Bridge. |
+| `MITM_SELECTED_ONLY` | `true` | `src/mitm/server.cjs` | Route only enabled, operator-selected integrations. |
+| `MITM_AUTO_RECOVER` | `true` | `src/mitm/bootRecovery.ts` | Restore the previously enabled native listener after gateway startup. Isolated builds and tests set this to `false`. |
+| `OMNIROUTE_CLOUD_SYNC_ALLOW_UNVERIFIED` | `false` | `src/lib/cloudSync.ts` | Explicit compatibility opt-in for unsigned cloud responses. Keep disabled when response signatures are required. |
+
 ### Quota-aware scheduling
 
 Used by `open-sse/services/combo.ts` and `src/lib/quota/quotaScheduler.ts` for pre-request token-budget checks. Opt-in — default routing behavior is unchanged when unset.
